{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And Aharon shall make atonement.</b> The application of blood." "<b>Once a year.</b> On Yom HaKippurim — as is said in Acharei Mot: ״וְיָצָא אֶל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ אֲשֶׁר לִפְנֵי ה' וְכִפֶּר עָלָיו״ (Leviticus 16)." "<b>The sin-offering of atonements.</b> They are the bull and the goat of Yom HaKippurim, which make atonement for the defilement of the Sanctuary and its holy things." "<b>Most holy.</b> The altar is consecrated for these things alone and for no other service."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:44.761357982Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}